---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with Studio BDY: email lee@studiobdy.com or connect with Lee Brady on LinkedIn. Based in Bath, working remotely with clients in the UK and internationally."
  current="contact"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container two-col">
      <div class="stack gap-m">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h1 style="font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 56px)">Talk to Lee.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Email is the best way to start. Say a little about the programme, the business or the problem, and Lee will come back to you, usually the same working day.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="mailto:lee@studiobdy.com" class="btn btn-primary">Email lee@studiobdy.com</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lee-brady/" rel="me noopener" class="btn btn-secondary">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-flat" style="gap: 20px">
        <div class="stack gap-s">
          <h3 style="font-size: 16px">Email</h3>
          <p><a href="mailto:lee@studiobdy.com">lee@studiobdy.com</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack gap-s">
          <h3 style="font-size: 16px">LinkedIn</h3>
          <p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lee-brady/" rel="me noopener">linkedin.com/in/lee-brady</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack gap-s">
          <h3 style="font-size: 16px">Where</h3>
          <p>Bath, United Kingdom. Remote first, on site in the UK when it helps, and clients in several countries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack gap-s">
          <h3 style="font-size: 16px">Company</h3>
          <p>Studio BDY Ltd, company number 13538439. Registered office: 38 Dollar Street, Cirencester, GL7 2AN.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What to expect</h2>
      <p>A first call of twenty or thirty minutes to understand where you are. If Studio BDY can help, you get a short written proposal: scope, cadence, what done looks like, and the day rate or fixed price. If it isn't the right fit, Lee will say so and, where he can, point you to someone who is.</p>
      <p class="small muted">Your email is used only to reply to you. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
